   "locked": false,
   "text": "DATABASE: the long-term storage. It keeps everything forever but only sees scrambled text, word codes and vectors. An\nengineer who opens it cannot read documents.",
   "originalText": "DATABASE: the long-term storage. It keeps everything forever but only sees scrambled text, word codes and vectors. An\nengineer who opens it cannot read documents.",
